     1	# Exposed UI
     2	
     3	Import components and public types from the `src/lib/ui/index.ts` barrel (for example `./lib/ui` from `src/Example.svelte`). Load `../lib/ui/styles.css` once in `src/routes/+layout.svelte`. It includes tokens, actions, patterns, focus rings, hidden captions, highlighted text and animation prerequisites. Field and Notice keep scoped styles. `/design-system` is the interactive reference in development only and requires no declarations API. Production returns 404 and hides its footer link.
     4	
     5	Features own amounts, availability, chart geometry, URLs, analytics and async work. UI accepts formatted strings and presentation models. Pages own grids and section spacing. Use the [composition recipes](COMPOSITION.md) for native rows, declarations and identities.
     6	
     7	| Component                              | Contract                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
     8	| -------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
     9	| Button, ButtonLink                     | `variant` primary/secondary/quiet/subtle; `size` regular/large/compact/inline. Native attributes and handlers pass through. Button defaults to `type="button"`; links require `href`.                                                |
    10	| Field                                  | Required visible `label`; `type` text/search/date; bindable string `value`; `defaultValue` supports native reset. `hint` and `error` join caller `aria-describedby`. Native attributes reach the input; `class` reaches the wrapper. |
    11	| SearchField                            | Required `label`, `help` snippet and `onclear`; bindable string `value` and native `input` reference; optional `shortcut`. Native attributes including `class` reach the input. Caller owns query behavior and focus restoration.    |
    12	| Notice                                 | `tone` neutral/accent/warning. Native div attributes pass through. Caller chooses announcement `role`.                                                                                                                               |
    13	| Badge                                  | `variant` result (default), profile or legend. `class` adds a root hook without replacing appearance.                                                                                                                                |
    14	| MessageState                           | Required `title`; `variant` centered (default) or detail; `level` 1/2 changes semantics independently of appearance. Optional `icon`, `children`, `actions`, `role`, additive root `class`.                                          |
    15	| SectionHeading                         | Required `id`, `title`; optional `level` 1/2/3 and trailing children. Heading presentation stays independent of rank.                                                                                                                |
    16	| Disclosure                             | Required `summary`, children; `variant` names (default) or plain. Native details attributes, additive root `class`, bindable `open`.                                                                                                 |
    17	| Metric                                 | Required `label`, formatted `value`; optional `regionLabel`, `available`, `description`, `level` 2/3. `variant` default or expanded. Available values remain keyboard-scrollable regions; unavailable text remains ordinary text.    |
    18	| DeclarationCard                        | Required `heading`, `registered`, children snippets. `variant` default or compact changes padding.                                                                                                                                   |
    19	| ValueRow                               | Required `source` and `value` snippets. Owns its `li` layout, including outside `.funding-list`; nested lists retain native layout.                                                                                                  |
    20	| DataTable                              | Required text `caption`, `head` snippet and body children. Callers supply native rows, cells, scope and column-specific classes. No numeric alignment or column widths are assumed.                                                  |
    21	| IdentityHeader                         | Required `name`, `kind`, `metadata`; optional `values`, `navigation`, `level` 1/2/3.                                                                                                                                                 |
    22	| ResultRow, DeclarationList             | Native `li` and `ol` wrappers; children and optional accessible `label`. ResultRow callers supply their own anchor and may add a root `class` for a local palette.                                                                   |
    23	| SignedBarList                          | `bars: SignedBar[]`, `baseline`; `variant` default or compact. Values are formatted strings; widths and signs come from features.                                                                                                    |
