{"body":"## Why\n\nReaders who use a light system theme currently get a dark application. Add a neutral light palette through the shared design system, with CSS selecting the theme automatically.\n\n## What changed\n\n- Use off-white and light gray surfaces with charcoal text. Preserve purple MP and teal funder accents through shared semantic tokens.\n- Match native controls, browser metadata, and the initial canvas to the active scheme before JavaScript or external CSS loads.\n- Update gallery swatches when the system preference changes.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Application pages and the development design-system gallery.\n- Financial calculations and party category colors retain their existing behavior.\n\n## Blast Radius\n\nShared colors affect every page and control. Existing dark values are preserved, and the dark landing screenshot matches the baseline exactly.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `npm run check` and `npm run build` passed.\n- The initial implementation passed all 82 browser tests. The neutral palette update passed all 48 affected browser tests, including theme contrast, live preference changes, and production first paint with JavaScript disabled and CSS blocked.\n- Independent review approved. Desktop light and dark views were inspected. The commit hook passed Clippy.\n\n![Landing page with neutral light surfaces](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ae611488-3f8d-45f0-a63e-e6f0dc39cd83)\n\n![Search results with neutral light surfaces](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a30f61d1-538a-43da-aeca-0c5fa5c7e430)\n\n![MP detail with neutral light surfaces](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/17f5ac19-6d39-4c4a-9c9d-fd318a00ddd8)\n\n![Funder detail with neutral light surfaces](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4a03f676-2417-4974-b22a-4610ff1e996b)\n\n![Design system with neutral light surfaces](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6d030002-8bef-432e-b8c5-5044836340a2)\n\n![Preserved dark mode landing page](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/339fb618-e8b2-41ed-b27e-8787acfbc489)","headRefName":"codex/design-system-light-mode","state":"OPEN","title":"feat(frontend): add system light mode to the design system","url":"https://github.com/johnnylarner/exposed/pull/108"}
